{
  "info": {
    "name": "Student Management System",
    "_postman_id": "b6f2a2f0-1b1a-4b6a-9b1a-student-mgmt-rbac",
    "description": "Auth + RBAC test collection for the Student Management System API.\n\nDesign notes reflected in this collection:\n- There is no manual \"create student\" endpoint. Every self-registered USER automatically gets a linked Student profile (name/email copied from registration, no course yet).\n- Course enrollment happens exclusively via POST /api/students/{id}/enroll.\n- Create endpoints return 201 Created, deletes return 204 No Content (no body), reads/updates return 200.\n\nSetup:\n1. Run the whole \"Auth\" folder once to create an admin and a regular user (the regular user's registration auto-creates its Student profile). This automatically sets {{userToken}}.\n2. The admin registration endpoint always returns role USER (self-registration can't grant ADMIN). Manually promote the admin account: update its `role` column to `ADMIN` in the `users` table, then run \"Login (Admin)\" to populate {{adminToken}}.\n3. Run the rest of the folders top to bottom (Collection Runner recommended).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "adminEmail", "value": "admin@test.com" },
    { "key": "adminPassword", "value": "AdminPass123!" },
    { "key": "userEmail", "value": "user@test.com" },
    { "key": "userPassword", "value": "UserPass123!" },
    { "key": "adminToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "userToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "studentId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "courseId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "courseId2", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register Admin (will start as USER)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "register"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Admin User\",\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\",\n  \"contactNum\": \"0771234567\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Also auto-creates a Student profile for this account (every registration does). That's harmless - once promoted to ADMIN, the leftover Student row is just unused."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('registered or already exists', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect([201, 409]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Register User",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "register"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Regular User\",\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\",\n  \"contactNum\": \"0777654321\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "This is now the only way a Student profile gets created - there is no POST /api/students endpoint."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('registered or already exists', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect([201, 409]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Register - Privilege Escalation Attempt (role ignored)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "register"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Sneaky User\",\n  \"email\": \"sneaky@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"SneakyPass123!\",\n  \"role\": \"ADMIN\",\n  \"contactNum\": \"0770000000\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "RegisterRequest DTO has no `role` field, so even sending one is silently ignored server-side and the account is always created as USER. Log in as sneaky@test.com afterwards and confirm the returned role is USER, not ADMIN."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('registered or already exists', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect([201, 409]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Only returns an ADMIN-role token if you manually set this user's `role` column to ADMIN in the DB first (self-registration never grants ADMIN)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('login succeeded', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', json.token);",
                  "pm.test('role is ADMIN (did you promote the user in the DB?)', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.role).to.eql('ADMIN');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (User)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('login succeeded', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('userToken', json.token);",
                  "pm.test('role is USER', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.role).to.eql('USER');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login - Wrong Password (401 expected)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"WrongPassword!\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            { "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('status is 401 Unauthorized', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(401); });"] } }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
